<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Rampart responsive test | Future Music</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --gold: #D4AF37;
      --bg: #0c0e12;
      --panel: #141820;
      --border: #2a3140;
      --text: #e8e6e0;
      --muted: #9aa3b2;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100%;
      background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
      font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .shell {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 260px) minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: 44px minmax(0, 1fr);
      height: 100vh;
      height: 100dvh;
      max-height: 100dvh;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .topbar {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 12px;
      background: #000;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .topbar a {
      color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-size: 12px;
    }
    .topbar h1 {
      margin: 0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      font-weight: 600; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .badge {
      font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .rail {
      background: var(--panel);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .rail h2 {
      margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold);
    }
    .rail code { color: #cde; font-size: 11px; }
    .stage {
      position: relative;
      background: #000;
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .stage iframe {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: 0;
      background: #000;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .shell { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: 44px auto minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .rail { max-height: 28vh; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <a href="/projects">&larr; Projects</a>
      <h1>Rampart · responsive test</h1>
      <span class="badge">test-3bkyzsrg</span>
    </header>
    <aside class="rail">
      <h2>What to check</h2>
      <p>Game UI should fit this stage <strong>without scrollbars</strong> on the game itself (top bar, map, bottom bar, menus).</p>
      <p>Resize the browser / try different window heights. Lobby + menu panels scroll <em>inside</em> their cards only if needed.</p>
      <p>Game path: <code>/games/rampart-reborn/test-3bkyzsrg/</code></p>
      <p style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;">Unlisted test page — not on homepage.</p>
    </aside>
    <main class="stage">
      <iframe
        title="Rampart Reborn test"
        src="/games/rampart-reborn/test-3bkyzsrg/index.html"
        allow="autoplay; fullscreen; gamepad"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
        allowfullscreen
      ></iframe>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
